WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Do not think of a white bear.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
To obey, the mind checks for the thought.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The checking can bring it into focus.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
1987: an experiment measured later rebound.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
2020: a review distinguished timing and cognitive load.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
A laboratory effect is not proof of an audio product.
